  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Pakistan - Distance Learning Workshop on Export Certification Process</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Under the USDA/FAS funded Pakistan Distance Learning Project - Davin Potts, APHIS/PPQ/POP delivered the in-country workshop for module 11 - Export Certification, in Pakistan. Workshop No. 6 in the series of in-country training seminars reviews and reinforces the learning elements of the Distance learning module 11 - Export Certification.</narrative>
